            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "يحب الرجل ربيبه مثل ابنه. yuḥibbu ar-rajul rabībahu mithla ibnihi. The man loves his stepson like his own son."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ربيبة is a stepdaughter."
            }
          ]
        },
