          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ربيب (rabīb) is built on the native Arabic root r-b-b, \"a lord, an owner; to rear\" (Lane). Lane gives rabīb as a wife's son, reared by her husband."
            }
          ]
